(*"date_time_schema.__identifier"
ISO/TC 184/SC 4/WG 12 N11634
*)

(*"date_time_schema.__status"
IS
*)

(*"date_time_schema.__title"
fundamentals_of_product_description_and_support
*)


(*"date_time_schema"
The subject of the *date_time_schema* is the definition of dates, both calendar and ordinal, time of day, combinations of date and time of day, and periods of time.
*)
(*"date_time_schema.__fund_cons"

Any kind of product data may have a date, time, or date and time associated with it.

*)
