the <<express:support_resource_schema.label,label>> by which the **time_interval_role** is known.
*)


(*"date_time_schema.time_interval_with_bounds"
A **time_interval_with_bounds** is a type of <<express:date_time_schema.time_interval,time_interval>>. The **time_interval_with_bounds** is bounded either on one side or both sides. If neither **secondary_bound** nor **duration** are specified, the time interval begins at the point in time identified by **primary_bound** and has no specified end point.
*)

(*"date_time_schema.time_interval_with_bounds.__example"
'From 01-01-1999 to 31-12-1999' is an example for a both side bounded *time_interval_with_bounds*, 'from 01-01-2000 on', and 'until start of production' are examples for a one side bounded *time_interval_with_bounds*.
*)

(*"date_time_schema.time_interval_with_bounds.primary_bound"
one of the bounds of the **time_interval_with_bounds**. The value of this attribute need not be specified.
*)


(*"date_time_schema.time_interval_with_bounds.secondary_bound"
the other bound of the **time_interval_with_bounds**. The value of this attribute need not be specified.
*)


(*"date_time_schema.time_interval_with_bounds.duration"
the <<express:measure_schema.time_measure_with_unit,time_measure_with_unit>> that specifies the length of a **time_interval_with_bounds**. If positive, the **time_interval_with_bounds** is a lower bounded **time_interval_with_bounds**, else an upper bounded **time_interval_with_bounds**. The value of this attribute need not be specified.
*)


(*"date_time_schema.time_interval_with_bounds.wr:WR1"
Either the **primary_bound** or the **secondary_bound** or both shall be specified.
*)


(*"date_time_schema.time_interval_with_bounds.wr:WR2"
The combination of **primary_bound**, **secondary_bound** and **duration** shall not be specified.
*)


(*"date_time_schema.time_interval_with_bounds.wr:WR3"
If **primary_bound** is specified and **secondary_bound** is not specified and if **duration** is specified, the **duration** shall be positive.
*)


(*"date_time_schema.time_interval_with_bounds.wr:WR4"
If **primary_bound** is not specified and **secondary_bound** is specified, **duration** shall be specified and the **duration** shall be negative.
*)


