the <<express:support_resource_schema.text,text>> that characterizes the **time_role**.
*)


(*"date_time_schema.time_role.description.__note"
This attribute is an upwardly compatible addition to *time_role* as specified in ISO 10303-41:1994
*)

(*"date_time_schema.time_role.wr:WR1"
Each **time_role** shall be the <<express:basic_attribute_schema.description_attribute.described_item,described_item>> in at most one <<express:basic_attribute_schema.description_attribute,description_attribute>>.
*)


(*"date_time_schema.time_role.wr:WR1.__note"
The <<express:basic_attribute_schema.description_attribute,description_attribute>> data type is defined in <<express:basic_attribute_schema,basic_attribute_schema>> of this document.
*)

